# shield/crescent: the Crescent shield, the pelta (P2c wave 2, SHIELDS; form5): the Dune soldiers' shield (PLAN Inventory).
# A round body whose top is cut into a crescent, two horns rising either side of the hollow; a metal rim lit on its
# top-left edges (the hollow's lower lip is lit too: it faces the light), the field lit as a convex face, the Dune's
# device a sun-star (eight points round a 3x3 boss: the arabesque at 1x). Keys and layers as the round shield's
# (STYLE_P2 25.5): rest, guard, block (a size up), lie (anchor pivot), back (slung, anchor neck); bash (the block's
# drawing leading the roll) and ride (the rest drawing on the reins arm) are appended by add_keys.py. Regions (contracts
# 3b): R the rim, P the field, G the boss, N the boards on the back, W one T1 wear spot. Written by the SHIELDS area's
# gen_shapes.py from hand-drawn masks (shade.py) and checked by eye at 1x, 3x and 8x. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role shield form5
layer shield
anchor gripL
keys shield
tags overlay
legend R field 1
legend S field 2
legend T field 3
legend F device 2
legend J device 3

legend Q glow 2
legend X glow 3
legend W glow 4
legend U glow 1


legend ( plume 0
legend < plume 1
legend > plume 2
legend ^ plume 3
legend ] metal2 4
legend [ metal2 0
legend ; leather 0
legend : leather 1
legend = leather 2
legend + leather 3

